# VOID Gaming Lounge — Mobile Menu

Single self-contained page. No build step, no dependencies — `index.html` has the
fonts, photos, logo and animation inlined.

## Deploy to GitHub Pages

1. Copy `index.html` into the root of `VoidGamingEg/Menu` on the `main` branch.
2. Repo → **Settings → Pages** → Source: *Deploy from a branch* → Branch: `main` / `/ (root)` → **Save**.
3. Live in ~1 minute at `https://voidgamingeg.github.io/Menu/`.
4. Point the in-lounge QR code at that URL.

## Notes

- Opening animation plays on every visit; visitors can tap **Skip**.
- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- To edit prices or items, change them in `VOID Mobile Menu.dc.html` in the design
  project and re-export — don't hand-edit `index.html`, it is compiled output.
